# Frontier-based exploration action

# Goal
float32 max_duration_sec   # Maximum exploration time (0 = unlimited)
float32 min_frontier_size  # Minimum frontier size in meters (0 = use default)
---
# Result
bool success               # True if exploration completed without critical error
uint32 frontiers_explored  # Number of frontiers visited
float32 area_mapped_m2     # Estimated area mapped in square meters
string message             # Human-readable result message
---
# Feedback
uint32 frontiers_remaining     # Number of frontiers left to explore
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped current_goal  # Current navigation target
float32 progress_percent       # Estimated progress (may be rough)
string status                  # Current status description
